Package: plotbb
Title: Grammar of Graphics on 'base' Graphics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Guangchuang", "Yu", email = "guangchuangyu@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6485-8781"))
Description: Implements a grammar of graphics on top of the 'base' graphics
  system. A 'bbplot' object is built incrementally with a '+' operator from
  data, aesthetic mappings and layers, then rendered with base graphics, so
  the layers can be mixed with ordinary base plotting calls. The package
  provides layers for points, lines, bars, histograms, densities, boxplots,
  violins, ribbons, smooths, error bars and tiles, together with colour and
  other aesthetic scales, automatic legends, faceting, themes, coordinate
  flipping and significance annotations.
Depends:
  R (>= 4.1.0)
